{"time": 1756178303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "651462037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=895686156]“怎么说这也是你自己刮的。”她没好气地看着你，“事到如今后悔了？我会处理好血的。”"}
{"time": 1756178373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "13831390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我应该没有招惹你吧........”"}
