{"time": 1756179047, "type": "recv", "message_id": "162469621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=13831390]\"当然...不过你的事可不是招惹那么简单。\"她手里的球浮到你面前，里面的眼睛看了你一眼，随后消失。你在球中看见了你自己...但是是作为魔人的那个自己。"}
{"time": 1756179072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1476568", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这不是我.....至少不是现在的我.”"}
{"time": 1756179375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "994340521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=651462037]“让人自己凌迟自己……怎么可能做得到，你是不是对我有什么不切实际的幻想”*有些无语"}
{"time": 1756179761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "800692132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1476568]\"这就是你，真正的你。\"她的声音带着蛊惑，暗示着你往她的话语思考，\"从来...不曾变过。\""}
{"time": 1756179828, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1096984591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“..我现在就是彻彻底底的人，之前从精神方面来看我也是人类，所以你说我不曾变过也对..我一直都是人类...”"}
{"time": 1756179897, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1993813879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“很痛啊……还不如让我把腿砍下来，剥完皮再接上……”"}
{"time": 1756180186, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1184139990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1993813879]她翻了个白眼，\"什么都想要?这就是所谓代价。\"你的右手又挥出一刀，片下第二块皮肉，\"忍着点，还剩两千九百九十八刀。 \""}
{"time": 1756180573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "694244606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1096984591]\"呵呵...你从出生开始就有魔族的血统，这辈子都不可能摆脱掉。\"球飞回她手里，\"所以，你今天注定会遇见我，对不对\""}
{"time": 1756180808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "859981800", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1184139990]“你等……呜！”*紧咬着牙，发出来源不明的尖锐声音，下刀的手和落刀的脚都触电般抽搐起来“代价是……要失去的东西，又不是……失去的过程”"}
{"time": 1756180906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "811243906", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=859981800]\"...\"她吐出口浊气，挥了挥手，你的右手暂时停了下来，\"行吧行吧，伊芙想怎么样?\""}
{"time": 1756180914, "type": "recv", "message_id": "956958844", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你到底是谁....”"}
{"time": 1756180936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1103687391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……至少让我晕过去吧”"}
{"time": 1756181078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1478218707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不痛怎么痛觉残留)"}
{"time": 1756181105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1505070737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（痛觉把拥抱的感觉全盖住了我还记什么）"}
