{"time": 1756215051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1293433608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1345365826]“不需要哦，现在，你只需要...嚣张并且无礼就可以。”她摸了摸你的脑袋"}
{"time": 1756215093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1823812020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真的吗？但是我嚣张无礼的话...里谢娜姐姐会不会不喜欢我”"}
{"time": 1756215196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "615580555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1823812020]“不会啦，毕竟，小粉丝要，为我而死呢？本来也是我要求的，哪会有偶像不喜欢自己的粉丝的？”"}
{"time": 1756215229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "60562036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对所有人吗....”"}
