{"time": 1756270774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "740405817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1609448594]（）"}
{"time": 1756271074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "22509363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1609448594]\"...这不是完全指望不上吗？\"里榭娜的声音，\"算了，先给她恢复正常，必要的时候...通过音响...\"吉尔内莉莎的声音，音响飞到你旁边，\"接下来，不论他们对你做什么，小粉丝只要配合就好，然后...假装恢复了正常。\""}
{"time": 1756271174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "835760077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对不起，里谢娜姐姐，我好没用”心里想着"}
{"time": 1756271236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1821255829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"总之，你要装作已经恢复了正常，后面的事情...跟从音响的引导。就这样\""}
{"time": 1756271271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2028525182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可是，对里谢娜姐姐的崇拜..我藏不住”"}
{"time": 1756271423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "642608677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你心里想的话她当然也听不到，只听见一声脆响，你突然如梦初醒，刚刚...发生了什么?只记得自己好像遇见了里榭娜，还遇见了一个很坏的人，床上躺着一个发箍，虽然不知道为什么，但你觉得发箍很重要，相当重要。"}
{"time": 1756271526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1042554573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1472269502]\"你做那些交易是为了早点死的话，那我也没什么可评价的。\"手里的胸针亮了亮，\"不行的话就换人，在学园里我有这个权限。\""}
{"time": 1756271526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "189182079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呜呜呜”怎么又被绑起来了"}
{"time": 1756271659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2861249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "我这是在哪，骑士团吗，怎么会在这里"}
{"time": 1756271802, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1799935637", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "过了一会，才有人推开门进来，你看见露莉亚端着饭菜，身后跟着莉夏，两人一起走了进来，露莉亚打量的眼神让你觉得怪怪的"}
{"time": 1756271827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1300414890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呜呜呜”用求助的眼神看着她们两"}
{"time": 1756271944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1453618100", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她把饭菜放下，回头看了一眼莉夏，上前把你嘴上绑着的东西解开"}
{"time": 1756271966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1725178526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露露，师父，我怎么被绑起来了...”"}
{"time": 1756272065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "291301060", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我明明记得我好像遇见了一个好好的人和一个坏的不得了的人，怎么被绑回来了？”想到里谢娜心里的崇拜之情感觉好像有点莫名的高"}
{"time": 1756272254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "155619790", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你被里榭娜影响了心智，现在看上去好了一点.. \"莉夏抱着手臂开口，\"暂时没有好的处理办法，得等到蜜姆回来。\""}
{"time": 1756272314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "68422739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“还有这回事吗，可是我感觉里谢娜姐姐不会做这种事的，我觉得她是好人”"}
{"time": 1756272514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1154861094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诺诺在中庭遇见了什么人?\"她看你这幅样子，无语地皱了皱眉"}
{"time": 1756272547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1404580037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm所有人吗，让我想想”"}
{"time": 1756272686, "type": "recv", "message_id": "555846846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾洛温家的小姐，艾莲娜教授，塑能系的学生艾璃西雅和她姐姐艾尔，伟大的里谢娜姐姐，还有一个人...让我想想，好像是个坏人，但我记得不太清了”"}
{"time": 1756272933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "320012697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我觉得我蛮正常的啊，露露，你和师父说说好话，把我放了吧”"}
{"time": 1756273318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2100588894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...在你身上的症状消失之前，看来都不能放了你。\"露露坐下来给你喂饭，\"张嘴，别说话\""}
{"time": 1756273359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1387000123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好..好吧，啊...”乖乖张嘴吃饭"}
{"time": 1756273604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1116101522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "吃过饭她们就准备走了，也没有留在这边。"}
{"time": 1756273637, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1587887323", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那...露露可不可以把那个发箍给我，有它在我身边，我被绑住也能安心点”"}
{"time": 1756273648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1912148429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1756273707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "261951576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也没什么事啊...算了，既然是师父和露露的判断，那应该是对的”"}
{"time": 1756273754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "994476207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "往床边蠕动“发箍...感觉它在身边有种安心的感觉”"}
{"time": 1756273991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1061424981", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你倒在发箍旁边"}
{"time": 1756274032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2021692878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你不太记得为什么会有这个，但是应该是相当重要的东西，而且让你很安心。"}
{"time": 1756274176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1195133322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看样子短时间师父不会把自己放出去了，这个发箍让人感觉好安心，被绑住的失落与无聊也感觉逐渐消散了，心情都莫名的愉快起来，反正也没事干，睡一觉吧"}
{"time": 1756274298, "type": "recv", "message_id": "134402566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那就睡一觉)"}
{"time": 1756274308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1245187191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我吃个饭先)"}
{"time": 1756275874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1151054635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1042554573]*暂时没有申辩的力气，不过至少念头只是一闪而过，毕竟刀就在自己怀里"}
