{"time": 1756277773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1102790364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(安装一下宽带)"}
{"time": 1756278410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "283746722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1151054635]\"有趣的事情正在发生，你要是再不动起来，也许就此错过了哦?\"她的声音愉悦，\"毕竟偶像的歌声，十年都听不到一次呢～\""}
{"time": 1756278843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181687703", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我……没兴趣”*咬了咬嘴唇“那种消遣……不适合我。那个空白契约，你打算怎么填？”"}
