{"time": 1756281794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "766599120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然被捆住，但在发箍的安慰下 也算睡了个好觉，梦里自己好像在听里谢娜姐姐唱歌，感觉好幸福"}
{"time": 1756281819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1344495684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "醒来之后反而感觉有种空荡荡的感觉"}
{"time": 1756282007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "860740152", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（现在他在cs了）"}
